---
import Welcome from '../components/Welcome.astro';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

---

<Layout>
	<main>
	<section class="seccion-1">
  <h1>One gesture can shape the future</h1>
  <p>ISDIN and the World Congress of Dermatology 2027 (WCD) have joined forces to create a global movement with a shared purpose: to inspire a future without skin cancer. This alliance is based on science, education, and a genuine commitment to prevention, with the aim of bringing daily sun protection to everyone, everywhere in the world. </p>
  <p>Now it’s your turn to join: share a photo of yourself protecting your skin from the sun and be part of the movement. Participants will be entered into a draw to win passes to experience WCD 2027. Together, for a future without skin cancer.</p>
</section>
	</main>
</Layout>

